/*
RECONSTRUCTION - this file is NOT the original InterfaceBouton of the EA library.
It was rebuilt on 2026-10-20 by outils/reconstruction.py from the symbol "InterfaceBouton" found in Afficheur8D.bdf.
Interface of an incremental rotary encoder: E1 and E2 are the channels A and B, sampled by H10k.
Pulse = 1 during one period of H10k after each rising edge of E1, Sens = NOT E2 at that time.
See RECONSTRUCTIONS.md for details.
*/
